      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leavenworth%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Leavenworth sits where Icicle Creek meets the Wenatchee River, a spot long used by Yakima, Chinook, and Wenatchi tribes for salmon fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
